aft; Horsemanship is its own catalog category and is offered as General and Exotic Animals only, on the Vehicle line''s remark that a Story Teller eventually acquires a horse. Hand to Hand: Basic, no others available, is costs: {}. || MONEY: 3D4x20 credits, as printed. || EQUIPMENT not stored as rows: one M.D. weapon of choice; butcher''s knife, meat cleaver, cooking utensils, frying pan, small pot, small kettle, bowl and grinder, a box of 100 large resealable plastic bags, cloak or long coat, bedroll, belt, boots, note pad, a dozen pencils and personal items have no catalog row and are in GM Notes. The book attaches the 600 lb test strength to the 10 feet of thin nylon cord here. || NOT STORED: Secret Resources (regard and influence) and the neutrality that lets a Muzhik cross between Warlords'' Spheres of Influence without fees or tribute are in GM Notes. The body text on printed 69 says they are well versed in medicine and practical skills; no numbers beyond the skill list."
